# STA complexity gate

Do not call `sequentialthinking` MCP on every message. Do not spawn STA on greetings or one-line edits.

| Score | Action |
| --- | --- |
| 1–2 | Parent only |
| 3–5 | `Task` `subagent_type: sequential-thinking-agent` this turn. Wait for `COMPLETED` before the user-facing answer. |

Context7 still runs when the question needs current library docs.

Resume a live STA with the cached `agentId` in `.grok/.state/sta-session.json` when the follow-up is the same problem.

Skill: `sequential-thinking-agent`. Docs: https://cursor.com/docs/subagents
